  betaFeaturesConfirmationBodyText: "Enabling the Creative Tools Beta unlocks currently in-development tools that are exclusive to this room. Using beta content in your rooms comes with the following risks:\n\n- We may make drastic changes to beta content, up to, and including breaking your creations that use beta content.\n- Any room that uses beta content forfeits the ability to be entered into official Rec Room creative contests.\n- Beta content cannot be used in inventions. This may change later.\n- Rooms that use beta content will be marked with a beta icon in the thumbnail, and will have the #beta tag.\n\nAre you sure you wish to turn them on? This will also save the room."
